  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region, given by the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is :"
  },
