  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0096_c8f7a0a6fb71.png\" style=\"width: 285px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>Given curves are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-coordinate of the intersection point is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Required area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></menclose><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
